{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/home/home_bundle_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:00:08.529972Z","id":"82e7e21e3908b60b65c1c9b0be31964385e6e22514e01d1d7aeb6590a134e73c","body":{"detail":"The test compares the bundle byte for byte with assets/kit/* as well as home/. tool/pack_home.dart refuses to repack changed files under the same version, and refuses without the seed at ~/.config/clax/home-bundle/key (scripts/build-home-bundle.sh). So a kit edit by anyone but the key holder leaves flutter test red until the owner bumps home/manifest.json version and release and runs just home-bundle; every kit edit is also a home release.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":41},"end":{"line":63},"content_hash":"72116e9b07f40e709578db4a81c26b25e40ab075b5f1b4e905330b62b7cd92cf"},"suggested_fix":"Say so where kit changes are made (docs/usage.md, the kit's README or header), or let the test report kit drift as a separate, clearly named failure that tells the reader to ask the key holder to repack.","summary":"Any change to a kit file the home manifest names (preact.js, icons.js, kit.css, kit.js, fake-home.js, LICENSES.txt) fails this test, and only the holder of the home signing key can repack","tags":["review","task:home-2","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/home/home_bundle_test.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-16T15:35:57.487009Z","id":"b39461e6a17c12d1827976fc9902b93db66728d99259265f2007b8c54953e7de","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:18be5678","summary":"home_bundle_test.dart compares the bundle's own files with home/ and only the kit file names with the manifest; kit content is a separate 'kit drift' test that calls markTestSkipped naming the drifted files. Appending a comment to assets/kit/kit.css: flutter test test/home/home_bundle_test.dart printed '+2 ~1: All tests passed!' with the drift reason naming kit.css. docs/usage.md 'The home app' (74ad487e) says how to repack with just home-bundle and that only the key holder can.","supersedes":"82e7e21e3908b60b65c1c9b0be31964385e6e22514e01d1d7aeb6590a134e73c","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
